    * @param conditions A JsonArray of filter conditions to evaluate for each object.
    * @param inclusive  If true, all conditions must be met (AND logic); if false, any condition can qualify an object (OR logic).
    * @return JsonArray of qualified object IDs that meet the specified conditions.
    *
    * The method iterates over each object and applies the provided conditions.
