                                        .put(MESSAGE,"Invalid entry of remote event processor")).encodePrettily())));

                LOGGER.warn(String.format("Invalid entry of remote event processor : %s  ", event.encodePrettily()));
            }
        }
        catch (Exception exception)
        {
